  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "The AudioEngine class serves as the core service provider for the entire audio subsystem, encapsulating the Web Audio API's AudioContext. It is responsible for constructing a complex, pre-configured audio routing graph, including sub-mix buses for synth, SFX, and music, and parallel return paths for global reverb and delay. It manages the context state (suspended/running) and exposes controlled access points for application-level audio manipulation."
  },
